### ARTR Veyra demo story (no containers)

# Start: .\build\RunDemo.ps1

### Proxy
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/a/hello
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/b/hello

### Canary (weights from ARTR:Veyra:Canary)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/canary/hello

### Per-route rate limit (Metadata.RateLimitPolicy=strict on /b)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/b/hello

### Admin / golden signals
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/_veyra/info
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/_veyra/diagnostics
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/_veyra/health/live
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/_veyra/health/ready

### Optional metrics (enable Observability:Prometheus:Enabled)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5080/metrics
